#: includes/admin/views/pro-ad.php:4
msgid "Upgrade to EDD Mollie PRO to receive subscription payments!"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/pro-ad.php:5
msgid "The EDD Mollie PRO extension enables support for Recurring Payments (with or without Software Licensing), allowing you to receive subscription payments via Mollie with any of the payment methods supporting this. For bank payments (iDEAL, bancontact, SOFORT, etc.) initial payments are processed as usual, and recurring payments are automatically processed via SEPA Direct Debit."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/pro-ad.php:6
msgid "Buy now"
msgstr ""

